# Agent tooling stays on the developer's machine, with one exception the
# owner asked for in September 2026: the shared skill set in .claude/skills
# is committed, so every session on this repo (and on Arun, which holds the
# same set) has the same tools without installing anything. The rest of
# .claude/ (local settings, caches) stays out. This line used to ignore all
# of .claude/, which is why an earlier "add the skills" commit silently
# committed none of them.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Playwright, installed with --no-save for the test suite. The site itself
# has no build step and no dependencies; this is test tooling only.
node_modules/
